			"notes": "Refactored fish core architecture — old saves may not be compatible.\n\nAdded Tactical Fishing minigame: a QTE-style tug-of-war upon hooking a fish, featuring stamina management. Press G to toggle.\n\nAdded universal fish actions. Various bug fixes."
