			"notes": "Update Summary\nThis update introduces a interactive 3D food models, powerful new status effects, and a progression system. We've added 14 new advancements to guide players from their first catch to mastering the kitchen.\n🏆 New Advancement System\n🎣 The Way of the Angler (Fishing & Basics)\nExploring the Waters: Welcome to the world of fishing\nFirst Bucket of Fish: Catch live fish with a bucket\nSetting Up Shop: Craft a Fish Stand to process fish\nCircle of Life: Obtain fish roe\nFeeding Time: Craft fish feed\nFisherman's Glory: Craft a Trophy Base\nStar's Protection: Obtain a Lucky Star\nDeboning the Catch: Process tagged fish for efficiency\n👨‍🍳 The Way of the Chef \nA Taste of the Sea: Collect all fish dishes\nTaste of the Sea: Cook all fish recipes\nFeast Time, Right Here!: Place all 3D gourmet foods\nSlice of the Starry Sky: Obtain a Starry Sky Pie\nVoid's Whisper: Gain the \"Void's Gift\" effect, unlocking hidden drop mechanics\n🍽️ 11 New Fish Cuisines\nA complete menu from snacks to feasts:\nSnacks: Fish Balls, Fish & Chips, Sushi, Fish Sandwich\nMain Courses: Braised Fish, Fish with Pickled Vegetables, Fish Curry, Sashimi Platter\nSoups: Fish Soup\nLegendary: Stargazy Pie, Starry Sky Sect\n✨ 8 Placeable 3D Food Models\nInteractive: Right-click to eat slice by slice, with dynamic model updates (Full → 2/3 → 1/3)\nDetail: Finishing leaves a decorative empty bowl/plate model\n💪 5 New Status Effects\n🫧 Oxygenating: Slowly regenerates oxygen underwater\n🔥 Frenzy: Consumes hunger for significant damage boost\n🌡️ Warm Current: Continuously regenerates health and grants freezing immunity\n📡 Abyssal Sense: Highlights nearby fish and aquatic monsters\n🌌 Void's Gift: Luck +2, triggers Double Drops and Bonus Loot Pools"
		},
